menu "E-paper probe"

config PROBE_SDA
    int "Qwiic bus SDA GPIO (a header pin)"
    default 8
    range 0 48

config PROBE_SCL
    int "Qwiic bus SCL GPIO (a header pin)"
    default 9
    range 0 48

config PROBE_SPI_HZ
    int "Panel SPI clock in Hz"
    default 4000000
    range 1000000 20000000

config PROBE_PARTIALS
    int "Partial refreshes to time after the full one"
    default 5
    range 0 50

config PROBE_SLEEP_S
    int "Deep sleep between runs in seconds (0: stay awake)"
    default 60
    range 0 86400
    help
        Before sleeping the probe puts the panel in deep sleep and cuts its
        supply (GPIO 7 low, held), so the last screen stays visible at zero
        panel power. Measure the board's sleep current from the battery
        connector with USB unplugged.

endmenu
